    "detailed_description": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/d9a0820fc86f0a5355435f4f39f3b19b.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/8933ee442104320662fe6a8e407ad442.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br>The religious city of Logres.<br>In a city that worships the Goddess of Fortune, an angel descends.<br>Her name is Zerachiel.<br>Zerachiel struggles to rescue her comrades who are imprisoned by the cult, but she is defeated and stripped of her powers by a girl claiming to be a saint...<br>Weeks later, Zerachiel, discarded like trash and set free, decides to take revenge on the cult, unaware that fate had already taken a significant turn.<br>A tapestry of intersecting destinies and a drama of many lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br>This work is a turn-based battle JRPG.<br>The player controls Zerachiel and her companions to fight against enemies and uncover the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>JRPG<br></li><li>Adopts CTB (Charge Turn Battle), allowing actions in the order of highest agility<br></li><li>Weapons can be enhanced<br></li><li>Random dungeons available</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/d9a0820fc86f0a5355435f4f39f3b19b.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/8933ee442104320662fe6a8e407ad442.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=280 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br>The religious city of Logres.<br>In a city that worships the Goddess of Fortune, an angel descends.<br>Her name is Zerachiel.<br>Zerachiel struggles to rescue her comrades who are imprisoned by the cult, but she is defeated and stripped of her powers by a girl claiming to be a saint...<br>Weeks later, Zerachiel, discarded like trash and set free, decides to take revenge on the cult, unaware that fate had already taken a significant turn.<br>A tapestry of intersecting destinies and a drama of many lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br>This work is a turn-based battle JRPG.<br>The player controls Zerachiel and her companions to fight against enemies and uncover the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804550/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752718301\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>JRPG<br></li><li>Adopts CTB (Charge Turn Battle), allowing actions in the order of highest agility<br></li><li>Weapons can be enhanced<br></li><li>Random dungeons available</li></ul>",
